    <defName>TM_Bridge_CommanderWorkCrew</defName><label>Work Crew</label><description>Give a work order to up to three nearby allies. Accepted orders grant 10/15/20% work speed for 10 seconds while they continue their job. Costs 20% stamina. Cooldown 45 seconds.</description>
